---
description: Use design tokens instead of hardcoded style values
globs: ["**/*.css", "**/*.scss", "**/*.tsx", "**/*.jsx", "**/*.vue", "**/*.svelte"]
alwaysApply: false
---

When writing styles, look up the repository's design tokens with the Buoy MCP tools before using a literal value:
`find_token_for_value` for a specific colour or size, `list_design_tokens` to browse. After editing style files,
run `check_design_drift` on them and apply the suggested tokens. Reference tokens as `var(--name)` (or `$name` in Sass);
never wrap a dotted JSON token path in `var()`.
